        "change": "No change is needed for this unit. If this path is touched later, add a row where the engine follow is refused at the helm and the stop arrives during the channel duty.",
        "claim": "One stop check in the runner loop has no test: the check after the channel duty on the path taken when an engine follow is refused while a person holds the helm. Removing it leaves the new drain test green. The slice works and is safe without a test for it: the brief does not list this site among its thirteen, and without the check the loop would only run the landing keeper before its wait notices the stop.",
