        "evidence": "internal/steward/runner.go line 462 is the check. In a scratch copy, removing it left TestAStoppedRunnerBeginsNoFurtherDuty passing, while removing each of the other 14 checks made it fail. The test's engine-follow fake returns refused=false, so this branch is never entered.",
